{"work_id": "MX5-008", "matched_key": "做一个完全的革命派", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "做一个完全的革命派一九五年六月二十三日中文马克思主义文库毛泽东做一个完全的革命派一九五年六月二十三日这是毛泽东同志在中国人民政治协商会议第一届全国委员会第二次会议上的闭幕词此次会议总结了过去时期的经验决定了各项方针这种总结经验和决定方针的工作是我们大家一起来做的是各民族各民主阶级各民主党派各人民团体和各界民主人士的代表人物集合在一起来做的这里不但有人民政协全国委员会的委员们而且有中央人民政府各大行政区人民政府军政委员会1及各省市人民政府的许多工作人员列席参加讨论而且有各省市", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-46b7ed1605f6749eeddc", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/marxist.org-chinese-mao-19500623.htm", "raw_sha256": "6c873a4d04bfcfdaf0f6206ac04626298eb654efbbaa9fdb389f1f527f09c8f1", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mia-catalogue", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end": 22, "record_path": "archive/records/A-46b7ed1605f6749eeddc.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-46b7ed1605f6749eeddc.txt", "source_title": "做一个完全的革命派", "source_media": "html", "source_layer": "web_transcription", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-0fedb05e7e518547", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX5-008", "matched_key": "做一个完全的革命派", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "做一个完全的革命派一九五〇年六月二十三日此次会议总结了过去时期的经验决定了各项方针这种总结经验和决定方针的工作是我们大家一起来做的是各民族各民主阶级各民主党派各人民团体和各界民主人士的代表人物集合在一起来做的这里不但有人民政协全国委员会的委员们而且有中央人民政府各大行政区人民政府军政委员会1及各省市人民政府的许多工作人员列席参加讨论而且有各省市各界人民代表会议协商委员会的代表们列席参加讨论而且有许多特邀的爱国人士列席参加讨论这样我们就能集中广泛的意见检查过去的工作决定今后的", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86.pdf", "raw_sha256": "e65195a022c0a066d8bbcf68fcf452a764f7f759019331cf153dadd16233d242", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mirror-combined-unverified", "volume": null, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 1234, "end": 1234, "record_path": "archive/records/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-0f0667708383fc8d", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
